---
interface Props {
  context: string;
}

const { context } = Astro.props;
const contact = "jonesg158@gmail.com";
---

<section>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Send requests to <a href={`mailto:${contact}`}>{contact}</a> and include
    the context <strong>{context}</strong>. This monitored address handles the
    three channels below; naming the request type keeps their procedures distinct.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Evidence correction</h2>
  <p>
    For an ordinary evidence correction, identify the displayed statement, the
    proposed correction and the primary source supporting it.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Formal right of reply</h2>
  <p>
    State explicitly that the message is a formal right-of-reply request and
    identify the passage concerned. It will not be treated as an ordinary
    evidence correction.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Data-protection request</h2>
  <p>
    State explicitly that the message is a data-protection request and identify
    the affected information or GDPR right. It will be handled separately from
    editorial corrections and rights of reply.
  </p>
</section>
